022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wz=pT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a044f24a-064d-48ed-babf-ade6facfa5cf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"undoableは大事","ts":"1635003278.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cV7wa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"804f90c9-270a-40f8-9dd4-0a3ffc1a747c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちょっと考えたけど、私は undoable でないアクションに抵抗があるんですよね。で、PR を作ると言うアクションは undoable ではないんですよ","ts":"1635003263.021900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SlxB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d8e1855-02e5-4b25-bab5-26ee14a45357","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"砂場の方を消せばCIのログも綺麗に消えて磐石","ts":"1635003232.021200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BLU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bde16cfa-2791-48f6-9b32-37cc6a22acf4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"GitHub、PRとissueで共通の番号を増やしていくから混乱する……。","ts":"1635003231.021100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6oi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d15e8902-f6e3-4be6-bd9b-b9a7f186d567","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"CI仕込む段階の試行錯誤と整理のため砂場にcloneしていじり回してからその内容をsquashしてしれっとmasterにpushしたことがある","ts":"1635003212.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wUMah"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01f8e927-0ce8-415d-b971-18da7d725c02","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"PR を作ると PR 番号が 1 つ進むのがなぜか個人的に抵抗がある。なんでかは自分でもよくわからない…","ts":"1635003197.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delet