m":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LVgCD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecdc6f2f-ab8e-4a4a-9ca0-25e07acca3ee","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"PR ベースではやってないけど、自信ない部分の場合はブランチ切って push して CI 回して通ったら手元でマージしてベースを進めるみたいなことはやったりする","ts":"1635002780.015300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DrFK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2387cc83-f20d-46bd-b3c9-cbe9c90de15b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"落ち着いたら切り替えようとは思ってるんですが、この安定してない時期からやるのはしんどくて","ts":"1635002721.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2LJu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a877a37f-3706-4a47-a4f8-38e7bbdee757","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まあ面倒ですよねw","ts":"1635002678.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZbxY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c620139-6915-4241-bce7-b2815946839d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちゃんとやってる人えらいなって思ってる","ts":"1635002678.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bcf48cc-abe3-4258-b159-dca24ef9d1f6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでも私も面倒で個人開発では PR ベースはやってないのでわかる","ts":"1635002667.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lGD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54be778c-7e5d-4753-9d64-7220e55226fb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど、私もそうしようかな","ts":"1635002662.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NpG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da351a5f-4993-4266-bcc5-a554fbb75fd9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"理想を言うと PR ベースの開発にすれば別にテストコケるコミットを push しちゃってもマージ前に CI でわかるからいいやってなるんですけどね","ts":"1635002645.012200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e64bd66-b183-4b6a-bc75-b004b4df726c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"hookには`exit 1`だけ書いてて、手癖で`git push`するのを弾く物","ts":"1635002617.011600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Zu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4922a9d-65c8-4aa2-8660-37284fa4050b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"hookにより場合によって`git push`でこけるようにするのは安全装置としてあまり好きではなく、自分で書いたスクリプトを叩く癖を付けたい感じです","ts":"1635002573.010600","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1635002638.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sI/fg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78a4bbb7-2537-41dd-b6df-0a964686fd71","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"このスクリプト以外からpushできないようにしたくて全て弾くような物をhookには書いてる","ts":"1635002496.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p3c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d5df3fc-a74a-43d4-84f2-c1ec10f4ef66","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あーこれはhookとは別に置いてます","ts":"1635002478.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vtpC6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80ec47e4-5dc9-4bf7-9ac6-0f17013a428f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あんまり hook 使わないのでわかってないんですけど、これスクリプト内で push するものなんです?","ts":"1635002416.008600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fi6KI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dfffe7f-80b1-4fdc-bf69-d686ea7bc786","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あざます:cat-dogeza-mike:","ts":"1635002376.007800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jv8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fc61f36-524f-4374-ae0a-398fa6bc2685","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ですね","ts":"1635002359.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ObUl4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea216d5a-70a1-4da1-a7f2-f951f630a621","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`trap \"git stash pop\" EXIT`で行けましたね","ts":"1635002355.007200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jNn9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19660825-3697-4df3-a62e-6014e8ff2173","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"勘違いだった","ts":"1635002338.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nfa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a713cc44-815f-43c5-bf09-57ce623693d6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"trapが関数しか受け付けないと思ったため","ts":"1635002328.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HrLx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e277d46-e856-4595-a5d4-7e290757c026","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"pop を関数にしたのはなんでだろう","ts":"1635002283.005800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=79J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b674714-3942-4333-9789-488300b02b31","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`--no-verify`されると敗北するけどまあそれは手癖になってないので","ts":"1635002077.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xeY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4c27319-6a70-4cea-8209-c42ec568e138","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"テスト通らないcommitをpushしてしまうやつへの対策として\n```#!/bin/bash -eu\n\npop() {\n  git stash pop\n}\n\ntrap pop EXIT\n\ngit stash -u\ndeno fmt --check\ndeno lint\ndeno test --unstable -A\ngit push --no-verify```\nこんなスクリプトを置いた上でpre-pushで全てを弾くようにしてこれ通さないといけないようにしてみた","ts":"1635002059.005000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BZe"}]}]
